  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/663/812/sem-titulo-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><em><strong>厌倦了游戏默认的剑？</strong></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>本模组为游戏添加了10把全新武器！&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>后续还将持续追加更多剑类武器</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这些剑的设计灵感源自现实科学理论！例如：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>核面之剑</strong></span></p><p>宇宙中最坚硬的物质锻造！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蓝锥矿之剑</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">由世界上最稀有的矿物打造</span></p><h2>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 全部新增物品</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>绿宝石剑</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">玩家期待已久的绿宝石材质武器</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>合成配方</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1木棍 + 2绿宝石</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>下界之星剑</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">用游戏中最稀有的物品打造，原版功能单一的珍贵材料终于有了用武之地</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>合成配方</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1钻石剑 + 1下界之星（锻造合成）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>暗物质</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">宇宙中最神秘深邃的物质</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>4末影珍珠 + 4下界之星 + 1核面物质</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>暗物质之剑</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">模组中最强武器之一，由暗物质锻造</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>1暗影木棍 + 2暗物质</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>暗影木棍</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">注入暗物质能量的特殊木棍</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>1木棍 + 6末影珍珠 + 1黑曜石 + 1末地水晶</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>玻璃剑</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">一击即碎...真的只能攻击一次</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>1木棍 + 2玻璃</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>红宝石</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">比钻石更稀有，甚至超越下界合金的矿物</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>获取方式</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>开采红宝石矿石</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>红宝石剑</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">红宝石锻造的华贵武器</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>1木棍 + 2红宝石</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>核面物质</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">宇宙最硬物质，强度是铁的100亿倍，近乎不可摧毁</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>获取方式</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>在末地开采矿石</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>核面之剑</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">永不磨损的神器，由宇宙至坚物质打造</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>1暗影木棍 + 2核面物质</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>紫水晶剑</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">用游戏中稀有的紫水晶晶体锻造</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><strong>1木棍 + 2紫水晶</strong></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>铜剑</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><strong>新手入门武器，威力较弱</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><strong>合成配方</strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><strong>1木棍 + 2铜锭</strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>蓝锥矿</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><strong>现实中最稀有的矿物！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><strong>获取方式&nbsp;</strong></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><strong>洞穴深处挖掘</strong></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>蓝锥矿之剑</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><strong>稀有矿物打造的至尊藏品</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><strong>合成配方</strong></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><strong>1木棍 + 2蓝锥矿</strong></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>究极之剑</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\"><em>集所有剑之大成的终极武器</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>合成配方</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>模组全部剑类 + 1暗影木棍</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>制作：CUBE_36</strong></p>",
